// misclassification (FrameGenerationEvaluate) made every shared-block DLSS/RR
// title look FG-only: Upscaled sessions flipped to Present and back (feature
// re-creates, history resets) in GoWR, CONTROL, KCD2, MSFS 2024 and
// Onimusha.  New routing stays opt-in until a field sitting shows it better.
inline constexpr uint32_t kAutoFgFallback = 0;
